OL,3,GNEWSAVan driver's lift helps officer   
OL,4,Acatch wanted thief                     
OL,6,FPriestley, of no fixed abode, was      
OL,7,Fjailed for 10 months after pleading    
OL,8,Fguilty to 28 shop thefts at Nottingham 
OL,9,FMagistrates' Court.                    
